flowchart LR
  A[Source revision] --> B[PR quality gates]
  B --> C[Default branch full QA/build]
  C --> D[Immutable web/backend/migration artifacts]
  D --> E[Release Candidate QA gate]
  E --> F[Staging promotion]
  F --> G[Migration rehearsal + E2E/security/perf/recovery]
  G --> H{Production evidence complete?}
  H -- no --> X[STOP / no production promotion]
  H -- yes --> I[Backup readiness]
  I --> J[Controlled migration job]
  J --> K[Roll API]
  K --> L[API readiness]
  L --> M[Roll workers]
  M --> N[Deploy web]
  N --> O[Post-deploy smoke]
  O --> P[Stabilization observation]
  P --> Q{Blocking signal?}
  Q -- yes --> R[Rollback / forward-fix / restore classification]
  Q -- no --> S[Release successful]
